---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Coherence Log">
  <article>
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>About Coherence Log</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Malaika, a PhD researcher at TU Wien's Atominstitut in Vienna,
      working on quantum sensing — spin defects in hexagonal boron nitride,
      ODMR-based sensing, and photonic integration toward a chip-scale
      sensing module.
    </p>
    <p>
      Coherence Log tracks what find genuinely interesting in quantum world,
      alongside software engineering trends. New entries land roughly every ten days, drafted with latest
      papers and articles, then reviewed and edited by us before
      they go live on this magzine.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or something you think we should cover? Reach
      out via the contact page.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
